# Exam track — Theme: Describing a Picture — Sub-lesson 1: At the Fair
#
# The Sproochentest speaking exam includes a picture-description task: the
# examiner shows a photo and asks the candidate to describe it, then follows up
# with questions about it. This sub-lesson drills that task for ONE photo:
# a busy Luxembourgish funfair (Schueberfouer-style) on a sunny summer
# afternoon — a Ferris wheel and a "Ghost Rider" ride in the background, food
# and game stalls left and right, a family (woman + boy) walking in the
# foreground, two girls in black clothes on the right, blue sky with a few
# clouds.
#
# Vocabulary and grammar are held to A1–A2 deliberately (present tense, simple
# main clauses, spatial adverbs + prepositions, no attributive adjectives on
# masculine nouns). This is stricter than the ~B1 guideline the other themes
# use — the picture task is where beginners can score, so the sentences stay
# assemblable.
#
# Mixed file: plain @sentence descriptions (either direction) AND @question
# examiner prompts (always assembled en→lu). Words the sentences lean on are
# taught alongside them, so a session alternates word-match and
# sentence-builder slots.

@lesson P1.01 "Fair: General Description"

# --- Talking about a picture ---
@word d'Bild = the picture
@word de Vierdergrond = the foreground
@word den Hannergrond = the background
@word lénks = on the left
@word riets = on the right
@word uewen = at the top
@word ënnen = at the bottom
@word beschreiwen = to describe
@word gesinn = to see
@word kucken = to look

# --- At the fair ---
@word d'Fouer = the fair
@word d'Riserad = the Ferris wheel
@word d'Bud = the stall
@word d'Buden = the stalls
@word d'Attraktioun = the ride
@word d'Attraktiounen = the rides
@word d'Musek = the music
@word d'Zockerwatt = the cotton candy
@word d'Fritten = the fries
@word de Spaass = the fun
@word de Bam = the tree

# --- Sky and weather ---
@word d'Wieder = the weather
@word den Himmel = the sky
@word d'Wollek = the cloud
@word d'Wolleken = the clouds
@word d'Sonn = the sun
@word sonneg = sunny
@word waarm = warm

# --- People and clothes ---
@word d'Leit = the people
@word de Jong = the boy
@word d'Meedchen = the girl
@word d'Fra = the woman
@word d'Kleedung = the clothing

# --- Colours and feelings ---
@word blo = blue
@word gréng = green
@word schwaarz = black
@word frou = happy

# --- Doing things ---
@word spadséieren = to go for a walk
@word trëppelen = to walk
@word droen = to wear
@word stoen = to stand
@word schéngen = to shine
@word ongeféier = approximately

@sentence
@lu Op dem Bild gesinn ech vill Leit.
@en In the picture I see a lot of people.
@distractor-lu keng
@distractor-lu Buden
@distractor-en no
@distractor-en stalls

@sentence
@lu D'Sonn schéngt an den Himmel ass blo.
@en The sun is shining and the sky is blue.
@distractor-lu Wollek
@distractor-lu gréng
@distractor-en cloud
@distractor-en green

@sentence
@lu Am Hannergrond gesinn ech d'Riserad.
@en In the background I see the Ferris wheel.
@distractor-lu Vierdergrond
@distractor-lu Bud
@distractor-en foreground
@distractor-en stall

@sentence
@lu Am Vierdergrond trëppelt eng Fra mat engem Jong.
@en In the foreground a woman is walking with a boy.
@distractor-lu Meedchen
@distractor-lu steet
@distractor-en girl
@distractor-en stands

@sentence
@lu Lénks a riets stinn vill Buden.
@en On the left and on the right there are a lot of stalls.
@distractor-lu uewen
@distractor-lu Beem
@distractor-en trees
@distractor-en behind

@sentence
@lu Uewen um Bild ass den Himmel mat e puer Wolleken.
@en At the top of the picture is the sky with a few clouds.
@distractor-lu ënnen
@distractor-lu Sonn
@distractor-en bottom
@distractor-en sun

@sentence
@lu Op der Fouer ass vill Musek an d'Leit hunn Spaass.
@en At the fair there is a lot of music and the people are having fun.
@distractor-lu keng
@distractor-lu Zockerwatt
@distractor-en no
@distractor-en cotton candy

@sentence
@question Wat gesitt Dir op dësem Bild?
@lu Op dësem Bild gesinn ech eng Fouer mat vill Leit.
@en In this picture I see a fair with a lot of people.
@distractor-lu keng
@distractor-lu Bud

@sentence
@question Wéi ass d'Wieder op dem Bild?
@lu D'Wieder ass schéin a sonneg.
@en The weather is nice and sunny.
@distractor-lu Wollek
@distractor-lu blo

@sentence
@question Wéi vill Leit gesitt Dir am Vierdergrond?
@lu Am Vierdergrond gesinn ech ongeféier fënnef Leit.
@en In the foreground I see about five people.
@distractor-lu Hannergrond
@distractor-lu zwee

@sentence
@question Wat maachen d'Leit op dem Bild?
@lu D'Leit trëppelen a kucken d'Attraktiounen.
@en The people are walking and looking at the rides.
@distractor-lu stoen
@distractor-lu Musek

@sentence
@question Wat kann een op der Fouer iessen?
@lu Op der Fouer kann een Fritten an Zockerwatt iessen.
@en At the fair you can eat fries and cotton candy.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu trëppelen

@sentence
@question Sinn d'Leit op dem Bild frou?
@lu Jo, si sinn frou an hunn Spaass.
@en Yes, they are happy and having fun.
@distractor-lu nee
@distractor-lu traureg

@sentence
@question Gitt Dir gär op d'Fouer?
@lu Jo, ech ginn all Joer gär op d'Fouer.
@en Yes, I like going to the fair every year.
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu Bud
